1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,222
A glacial lake above Hunza bursts

2
00:00:02,262 --> 00:00:04,600
and takes a highway bridge with it.

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,270
In summer, cloud hides lakes like it.

4
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,850
NISAR's radar sees straight through.

5
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,739
SARtale watches thirty-nine lakes,

6
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:14,530
and anyone can add more.

7
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,780
It turns dark radar pixels into water,

8
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,730
tracks each lake pass after pass,

9
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:24,300
and flags only changes bigger than its own noise.

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,640
When clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
